<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδέω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδης</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call, name,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i><i>Fr.anon.</i><i><span class="en">
				62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				47
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				525
			</span></i>; 
				Ep.
			 also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδείω</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Jov.</u>
				76
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be told of, to be called</i> so and so, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				257
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.528
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.264
			</span></i>:—<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				<u>Et.Gud.</u>
				539.56
			</span></i> also quote the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδειν</span>
			(from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδω</span>), and <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				19
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδειν: τρέχειν,
				λέγειν</span>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδεῖν</span> should perh. be restored for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδεῖν</span> in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.</u>
				 iii 15
			</span></i>, where it would mean <i>tell of, celebrate;</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ὑ]δέοντος</span> is suggested in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLit.Lond.</u>
				60.9
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i>).</div>
